ral turbaned character reacts dramatically—throwing his hands up and leaning back in shock before settling into an ornate throne-like chair. The remaining council members, including one in a green plumed hat covering their mouth, watch with concern. The scene conveys a tense, theatrical atmosphere through the detailed stop-motion puppetry and the characters' exaggerated expressions of alarm.", 'similarity score': 0.5634833574295044}, {'clip_271_271': 'clip_271_271', 'text': "In this brief 0.2-second clip of archival black-and-white footage, a dense crowd of people is gathered in what appears to be a stone courtyard framed by massive architectural columns in the foreground. The spectators, dressed in period clothing suggesting early-to-mid 20th century or earlier, are packed together with many raising their arms and gesturing energetically toward the left side of the frame. Behind the crowd rises a crenellated fortified wall, suggesting the setting might be a palace, fortress, or government building. At the center-left, partially obscured by the crowd and columns, there appears to be a mounted figure or horse, possibly the focus of the crowd's attention. The grainy film quality and high-contrast lighting create a stark, historical atmosphere, while the crowd's animated body language conveys a mood of excitement, agitation, or celebration. No visible text appears in the frame.", 'similarity score': 0.5627431869506836}, {'clip_302_302': 'clip_302_302', 'text': "This frame (at 302s) shows a **dark stop-motion animation scene** featuring two puppet figures in a gritty, cluttered environment.\n\n**Foreground**: A figure in dark, tattered clothing (appearing to wear a long coat or cloak) is captured mid-movement, walking away or passing through the frame. The figure has pale white hands/gloves and wears a dark satchel or pouch on its hip.\n\n**Background**: A small child or baby-like puppet sits abandoned on the dirty floor. It has a white painted face with distinct rosy r